          "attachment_identity": "python:The-Interdependency/ucns:src/ucns/unicode_gonol.py::function:unicode_scalar_turn",
          "description": "The full scalar numeric range is the stable modulus. Assignment status is\ndeliberately irrelevant, so future Unicode versions cannot move existing\nbearings. Surrogate values are holes, not compressed-away positions.",
